@page "/nutrition-diary"

<PageTitle>Nutrition Diary</PageTitle>

<section class="page-header">
    <p class="dashboard-label">Integration Page</p>
    <h1>Nutrition Diary</h1>
    <p>
        This page is prepared to connect with the Nutrition Diary feature developed by the team.
        It will support food search, meal type selection, grams consumed, and daily nutrition totals.
    </p>
</section>

<div class="feature-grid">
    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🔍</div>
        <h3>Food Search</h3>
        <p>
            Users will be able to search food items and select the correct food from the nutrition database.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🍽️</div>
        <h3>Meal Registration</h3>
        <p>
            Users will be able to register breakfast, lunch, dinner, or snack entries.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
        <h3>Daily Totals</h3>
        <p>
            The app will display daily totals such as calories, protein, carbohydrates, fat, and micronutrients.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>